      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Virus-like-particle HPV vaccines provide a clear, preventive route to reducing infection-associated cancers with extraordinary public-health importance.",
        "attribution": "Frazer, Lowy, and Schiller are a coherent attribution for the core vaccine concept and its development.",
        "maturity": "Protection against HPV infection and related disease is demonstrated at population scale after long follow-up.",
        "uncertainties": [
