        "attribution": "Feldmann and Maini form a focused and persuasive pairing linking pathogenic rationale to decisive clinical translation.",
        "maturity": "Its clinical value and wider influence have been sustained over decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "TNF biology and anti-TNF therapeutic development involved substantial wider contributions."
