      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "PCSK9 established an unusually powerful example of human genetics identifying a target for prevention of cardiovascular disease.",
        "attribution": "Hobbs and Cohen are central to human genetic validation, while Seidah is central to the molecular identification of PCSK9.",
        "maturity": "The mechanism and therapeutic consequences are strongly supported by genetics, biology, and clinical outcomes.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Several investigators made potentially prize-relevant discoveries in the pathway and its human genetics."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
