      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "cGAS-STING revealed a fundamental route by which cytosolic DNA activates innate immunity, reshaping understanding of infection, autoimmunity, and cancer immunity.",
        "attribution": "Chen, Barber, and Ishikawa reflect key contributions to defining DNA sensing and the STING pathway.",
        "maturity": "The pathway is mechanistically mature and has broad biological and disease relevance.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Attribution across the sequential discovery of cGAS, STING, and downstream signaling is complex.",
          "The long-term clinical impact of pathway-directed therapies remains less settled than its fundamental biology."
        ]
      }
    },
