        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett provide a concise pairing of splicing science and therapeutic antisense development.",
        "maturity": "Clinical efficacy is well demonstrated and the work has established a durable model for RNA medicines.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The relative roles of additional academic and industrial contributors require careful historical attribution."
        ]
      }
    },
