        "attribution": "Welsh supplied foundational CFTR physiology, while Van Goor and Negulescu represent central therapeutic-development contributions.",
        "maturity": "The functional rationale and substantial clinical benefit of modulator therapy are well established.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The program includes numerous essential contributors across CFTR discovery, assay development, medicinal chemistry, and clinical trials."
